fleet-plan includes files from html-plan, by Thariq Shihipar:
https://github.com/anthropics/claude-plugins-community/tree/main/html-plan
(commit f60f0454df3045f724c43c6346ec80bdcc3472b2)

html-plan's plugin.json names its author as Thariq Shihipar and declares "license": "MIT". html-plan publishes no
copyright line of its own. The repository it is published in, anthropics/claude-plugins-community, is licensed under
the Apache License, Version 2.0. Weave Fleet follows the terms of both:

- The MIT License text is below.
- The Apache License, Version 2.0, is in LICENSE-APACHE-2.0, as published in that repository.
- Weave Fleet changed runtime/htmlplan.js and runtime/htmlplan.css, and wrote SKILL.md from html-plan's SKILL.md.
  Each changed file says so at its top. UPSTREAM.md lists every file and every change.

